  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated and unified OSH system is in place and implemented</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the adoption of OSH law, ILO has been providing support in stakeholders capacity building aiming to foster government commitment to adopt the National OSH framework and strategies. In the previous biennium, the ILO, with funding from Government of Japan developed trainer&#x2019;s manual and student&#x2019;s handbook on OSH in skills training. Through ILO&#x2019;s financial support, ILO partners conducted TOT in Yangon for other skills training centres.</narrative>
  </description>
